<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>pre is monospace, keeps white space and has 1em vertical margins</title>
<meta name="assert" content="HTML 15.3.3: pre { display: block; font-family: monospace; white-space: pre; margin: 1em 0 }."/>
</head>
<body><pre>one  two
  three</pre><div>after</div>
</body>
</html>
